PE 880: Unraveled Digits / 展开数字

=== Digit Unraveling ===
Digit -> English length mapping:
  0 -> 4
  1 -> 3
  2 -> 3
  3 -> 5
  4 -> 4
  5 -> 4
  6 -> 3
  7 -> 5
  8 -> 5
  9 -> 4

=== Unravel Examples ===
unravel(123) = 335
unravel(456) = 443
unravel(789) = 554
unravel(100) = 344
unravel(999) = 444
unravel(12345) = 33544

=== Unravel Sequences ===
1: 1 -> 3 -> 5 -> 4 -> (loop)
2: 2 -> 3 -> 5 -> 4 -> (loop)
3: 3 -> 5 -> 4 -> (loop)
7: 7 -> 5 -> 4 -> (loop)
13: 13 -> 35 -> 54 -> 44 -> (loop)
42: 42 -> 43 -> 45 -> 44 -> (loop)
100: 100 -> 344 -> 544 -> 444 -> (loop)

=== Benford's Law ===
Leading digit 1: actual=0.1112, Benford=0.3010
Leading digit 2: actual=0.1111, Benford=0.1761
Leading digit 3: actual=0.1111, Benford=0.1249
Leading digit 4: actual=0.1111, Benford=0.0969
Leading digit 5: actual=0.1111, Benford=0.0792
Leading digit 6: actual=0.1111, Benford=0.0669
Leading digit 7: actual=0.1111, Benford=0.0580
Leading digit 8: actual=0.1111, Benford=0.0512
Leading digit 9: actual=0.1111, Benford=0.0458

